sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Author
  participant E as Editor
  participant H as Host view
  A->>E: → onto the fence
  activate E
  E->>H: open(region, home)
  Note right of H: takes the focus
  loop every keystroke
    H->>E: replace(content)
    E-->>H: reload when it differs
  end
  alt Escape
    H->>E: leave(after)
  else click elsewhere
    E->>H: close()
  end
  deactivate E
  Note over A,H: the document is the source of truth
